<title>USA: Rockwell International Q2 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Rockwell International Q2 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>SEAL BEACH, Calif. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Three months ended, March 31)</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.87		    $0.98</p>
<p> Net			189,000		  214,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,114,000		1,011,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 216,200		  217,300</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.69		    $1.87</p>
<p> Net			368,000		  406,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,175,000		1,991,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 217,400		  217,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 net income from continuing operations $155 million, or $0.72 a share vs $121 million, or $0.55 a share, and for the six months $309 million, or $1.42 a share vs $252 million, or $1.16 a share.</p>
